# el12 (2026-10-25): A/B of the deferred stores (deferstores on) on the full game and on the clean cut set; misses switch alone.
measure 60
base-1 60
defer-1 60 deferstores on
base-2 60
defer-2 60 deferstores on
base-3 60
defer-3 60 deferstores on
misses-1 60 switch APS5_PIPELINE_DISPATCH_MISSES on
base-m1 60
misses-2 60 switch APS5_PIPELINE_DISPATCH_MISSES on
base-m2 60
misses-3 60 switch APS5_PIPELINE_DISPATCH_MISSES on
base-m3 60
clean-1 60 switch APS5_PIPELINE_DISPATCH_MISSES on;;switch APS5_QUIET_PUBLISH on;;passx q0|Frame/Cascaded shadow map;;pass q0|Frame/Cascaded shadow map/;;passx q30|Directional Shadow Combine;;passx q30|Enqueue Shadow Resolve;;pass q30|Resolve Shadow Map Slice;;passx q38|Directional Shadow Copy;;pass q30|Screen Space Shadows;;pass Particle;;passx q38|Ambient Spec Update;;passx q38|Async ambient sh;;passx q38|Cull CS Lights;;passx q38|Volfog;;passx q38|SSR;;passx q48|Async Sh Grid Update;;passx q48|Async Clouds Update;;passx q30|Update Oct Maps;;pass q0|Frame/Deferred/Grass;;passx q0|Frame/Interior Volumes;;passx q0|Frame/Deferred wetness;;passx q0|Frame/Deferred/Tiled Decals;;passx q0|Frame/SSDO;;passx q0|Frame/Separable Scattering;;passx q0|Frame/Vcull;;pass q0|Frame/Vcull/;;passx q51|CS Cloth;;pass q0|Frame/Terrain Deformer Depth;;passx q0|Frame/Composite depth bias
clean-defer-1 60 switch APS5_PIPELINE_DISPATCH_MISSES on;;switch APS5_QUIET_PUBLISH on;;passx q0|Frame/Cascaded shadow map;;pass q0|Frame/Cascaded shadow map/;;passx q30|Directional Shadow Combine;;passx q30|Enqueue Shadow Resolve;;pass q30|Resolve Shadow Map Slice;;passx q38|Directional Shadow Copy;;pass q30|Screen Space Shadows;;pass Particle;;passx q38|Ambient Spec Update;;passx q38|Async ambient sh;;passx q38|Cull CS Lights;;passx q38|Volfog;;passx q38|SSR;;passx q48|Async Sh Grid Update;;passx q48|Async Clouds Update;;passx q30|Update Oct Maps;;pass q0|Frame/Deferred/Grass;;passx q0|Frame/Interior Volumes;;passx q0|Frame/Deferred wetness;;passx q0|Frame/Deferred/Tiled Decals;;passx q0|Frame/SSDO;;passx q0|Frame/Separable Scattering;;passx q0|Frame/Vcull;;pass q0|Frame/Vcull/;;passx q51|CS Cloth;;pass q0|Frame/Terrain Deformer Depth;;passx q0|Frame/Composite depth bias;;deferstores on
clean-2 60 switch APS5_PIPELINE_DISPATCH_MISSES on;;switch APS5_QUIET_PUBLISH on;;passx q0|Frame/Cascaded shadow map;;pass q0|Frame/Cascaded shadow map/;;passx q30|Directional Shadow Combine;;passx q30|Enqueue Shadow Resolve;;pass q30|Resolve Shadow Map Slice;;passx q38|Directional Shadow Copy;;pass q30|Screen Space Shadows;;pass Particle;;passx q38|Ambient Spec Update;;passx q38|Async ambient sh;;passx q38|Cull CS Lights;;passx q38|Volfog;;passx q38|SSR;;passx q48|Async Sh Grid Update;;passx q48|Async Clouds Update;;passx q30|Update Oct Maps;;pass q0|Frame/Deferred/Grass;;passx q0|Frame/Interior Volumes;;passx q0|Frame/Deferred wetness;;passx q0|Frame/Deferred/Tiled Decals;;passx q0|Frame/SSDO;;passx q0|Frame/Separable Scattering;;passx q0|Frame/Vcull;;pass q0|Frame/Vcull/;;passx q51|CS Cloth;;pass q0|Frame/Terrain Deformer Depth;;passx q0|Frame/Composite depth bias
clean-defer-2 60 switch APS5_PIPELINE_DISPATCH_MISSES on;;switch APS5_QUIET_PUBLISH on;;passx q0|Frame/Cascaded shadow map;;pass q0|Frame/Cascaded shadow map/;;passx q30|Directional Shadow Combine;;passx q30|Enqueue Shadow Resolve;;pass q30|Resolve Shadow Map Slice;;passx q38|Directional Shadow Copy;;pass q30|Screen Space Shadows;;pass Particle;;passx q38|Ambient Spec Update;;passx q38|Async ambient sh;;passx q38|Cull CS Lights;;passx q38|Volfog;;passx q38|SSR;;passx q48|Async Sh Grid Update;;passx q48|Async Clouds Update;;passx q30|Update Oct Maps;;pass q0|Frame/Deferred/Grass;;passx q0|Frame/Interior Volumes;;passx q0|Frame/Deferred wetness;;passx q0|Frame/Deferred/Tiled Decals;;passx q0|Frame/SSDO;;passx q0|Frame/Separable Scattering;;passx q0|Frame/Vcull;;pass q0|Frame/Vcull/;;passx q51|CS Cloth;;pass q0|Frame/Terrain Deformer Depth;;passx q0|Frame/Composite depth bias;;deferstores on
base-z 60
